      "content": "it's just not just a \"moment\" of stress though. it's like... every single day is the same. i wake up, i work, i pay bills, i sleep, and then i do it again. but the bills never actually stop growing. it feels like the system is designed so that i can never actually win, i'm just surviving until I eventually can't. it feels like a trap that's already closed around me. does it ever feel like there's actually any way out of that cycle?",
